passages.text:
[PH] You can requisition new troops.

Go speak to the trainers of these schools and train our first batch of recruits. 
 See if you've already completed this by typing:

 /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(42130))
 WH.clickToCopy(document.currentScript.parentNode, "\/run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(42130))");





 const cta = WH.Tools.createWowheadClientCta();
 if (cta) {
 $('.db-page-collection-tracker-cta').append(cta);
 }

This was all I had to offer you, young scribe. But your journey is not yet at the end.

Go to your trainer and and inform them of your success here.

<Kronah grabs an odd-looking jar.>

I don't suppose you'd like to take some pickled crocolisk eggs with you for the road, would you?

<As she unlocks the lid, the foulest odor you've ever smelled permeates the air and you reel back in disgust.>

Fine, be that way. It's an acquired taste any ways. Takes thousands of years to train the palette. 
