Now dat you be done learnin' all da contracts, you be needin' one more ting ta learn.

Dere be a special quill ya need to make in order to craft da contracts. And dere be one last trial ya must complete in order ta be worthy ta learn da design for da quill.

Miju be da mastah in charge of da design. Pass his trial, and he'll be teachin' ya what'cha need ta know. 
